Description: Install mate-redshift.desktop, only under "Look and Feel"
 i18n.merge_file() is called without "install: true", so the desktop file
 is generated but never installed and the dialog has no menu entry.
 .
 The control centre's "Look and Feel" menu (matecc.menu and
 mate-preferences-categories.menu) selects Settings + DesktopSettings;
 "Personal" needs X-MATE-PersonalSettings, so that category must not be
 added (the stale comment suggesting it is removed).
Author: Menta Linux <packages@menta-linux.invalid>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-14

Index: mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba/meson.build
===================================================================
--- mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba.orig/meson.build
+++ mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba/meson.build
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ i18n.merge_file(
   output: 'mate-redshift.desktop',
   type: 'desktop',
   po_dir: 'po',
+  install: true,
   install_dir: get_option('datadir') / 'applications')
 
 subdir('po')
Index: mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba/data/mate-redshift.desktop
===================================================================
--- mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba.orig/data/mate-redshift.desktop
+++ mate-redshift-0.1.0+git20261022.c2f3fba/data/mate-redshift.desktop
@@ -6,7 +6,6 @@ Comment=Make the screen warmer at night
 Exec=mate-redshift
 Icon=redshift
 Terminal=false
 Categories=GTK;Settings;DesktopSettings;
-# Can be also under X-MATE-PersonalSettings;
 Keywords=redshift;rojo;night;light;color;temperature;blue;
 StartupNotify=true
